    "name": "Rite of Eris",
    "steam_appid": 2779800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/e4c4267f25caf57a3aaf48419584827b.avif?t=1721522934\" width=388 height=72 /></span><br><br>Embark on an epic journey in \u201cRite of Eris\u201d, a captivating 3D survivor roguelike game inspired by the intensity of Vampire Survivors, the characters of Paragon, and the immersive world of Hades.<br><br>In this game, you\u2019ll navigate through a world of chaos, a tribute to Eris, the Greek goddess of strife and discord. Each playthrough is a unique rite, a test of your ability to thrive in the midst of turmoil. Will you succumb to the chaos, or will you harness it and survive against all odds?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/7c53b8737f8ab951cb158594a2bbdced.avif?t=1721522934\" width=388 height=72 /></span><br><br>Experience the thrill of survival in stunning cinematic 3D. Uncover hidden secrets, battle formidable foes, and navigate treacherous terrains. The world of Eris awaits you. Are you ready to accept the rite? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/b685a9554ee1a5d6bac62002e99fc614.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/b685a9554ee1a5d6bac62002e99fc614.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/b685a9554ee1a5d6bac62002e99fc614.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock new characters, each with their own unique abilities, then jump into battle, unlocking powerful abilities along the way to aid your conquest against hordes of enemies. Awaken massive boss monsters and strategically use their attacks against other enemies! Learn and unlock new passive upgrades, and much more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/573792f0b08cd19faf54eac0cab8275b.avif?t=1721522934\" width=661 height=300 /></span><br><br>Currently includes 2 maps, 2 bosses, and 3 characters, but expanding to the full roster quickly!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/02de1522865752e4456ffde88bdac3d0.avif?t=1721522934\" width=666 height=300 /></span><br><br>Take on Rampage in the Ruins of Mystras.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/264a4fbc5a5287e65f3bc738e3e46af0.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/264a4fbc5a5287e65f3bc738e3e46af0.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/264a4fbc5a5287e65f3bc738e3e46af0.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Escape Poison Sevarog in the Tower of Hera.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/2de43f9f5c91abc5249ef46e2d3564a3.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/2de43f9f5c91abc5249ef46e2d3564a3.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/2de43f9f5c91abc5249ef46e2d3564a3.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Battle Terra in the Gladiator's Arena.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/939b02aafda540b49d6cf2b96d30d1dc.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/939b02aafda540b49d6cf2b96d30d1dc.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/939b02aafda540b49d6cf2b96d30d1dc.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/e4c4267f25caf57a3aaf48419584827b.avif?t=1721522934\" width=388 height=72 /></span><br><br>Embark on an epic journey in \u201cRite of Eris\u201d, a captivating 3D survivor roguelike game inspired by the intensity of Vampire Survivors, the characters of Paragon, and the immersive world of Hades.<br><br>In this game, you\u2019ll navigate through a world of chaos, a tribute to Eris, the Greek goddess of strife and discord. Each playthrough is a unique rite, a test of your ability to thrive in the midst of turmoil. Will you succumb to the chaos, or will you harness it and survive against all odds?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/7c53b8737f8ab951cb158594a2bbdced.avif?t=1721522934\" width=388 height=72 /></span><br><br>Experience the thrill of survival in stunning cinematic 3D. Uncover hidden secrets, battle formidable foes, and navigate treacherous terrains. The world of Eris awaits you. Are you ready to accept the rite? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/b685a9554ee1a5d6bac62002e99fc614.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/b685a9554ee1a5d6bac62002e99fc614.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/b685a9554ee1a5d6bac62002e99fc614.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock new characters, each with their own unique abilities, then jump into battle, unlocking powerful abilities along the way to aid your conquest against hordes of enemies. Awaken massive boss monsters and strategically use their attacks against other enemies! Learn and unlock new passive upgrades, and much more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/573792f0b08cd19faf54eac0cab8275b.avif?t=1721522934\" width=661 height=300 /></span><br><br>Currently includes 2 maps, 2 bosses, and 3 characters, but expanding to the full roster quickly!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/02de1522865752e4456ffde88bdac3d0.avif?t=1721522934\" width=666 height=300 /></span><br><br>Take on Rampage in the Ruins of Mystras.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/264a4fbc5a5287e65f3bc738e3e46af0.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/264a4fbc5a5287e65f3bc738e3e46af0.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/264a4fbc5a5287e65f3bc738e3e46af0.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Escape Poison Sevarog in the Tower of Hera.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/2de43f9f5c91abc5249ef46e2d3564a3.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/2de43f9f5c91abc5249ef46e2d3564a3.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/2de43f9f5c91abc5249ef46e2d3564a3.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Battle Terra in the Gladiator's Arena.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/939b02aafda540b49d6cf2b96d30d1dc.poster.avif?t=1721522934\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/939b02aafda540b49d6cf2b96d30d1dc.webm?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779800/extras/939b02aafda540b49d6cf2b96d30d1dc.mp4?t=1721522934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
